This project is based on TradingAgents, the multi-agent LLM financial research
framework developed by Tauric Research and its contributors.

Upstream source: https://github.com/TauricResearch/TradingAgents
Upstream paper: https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.20138

ThesisFlow adds a personal research workbench, account and connection management,
market and thematic observations, research evidence, investment plans, and manual
review workflows. The TradingAgents engine package and compatible commands retain
their original technical names.

The upstream attribution and Apache License 2.0 text are retained in this
repository. See LICENSE and backend/LICENSE for the license text and README.md
for the project and upstream documentation.
